	depends on TLSR_BLE_DEEP_SLEEP
	help
	  ble_deep_sleep() calls the board's board_deep_sleep_pads() instead
	  of its own setup (every column at its active level through a pull,
	  the rows and the switch as wake pads), for a board that needs
	  another state there: on the V75 Pro the columns go to 0 through
	  pull-downs, the rows wake on low, and the switch's common pin is
	  driven (cidoo_v75pro/deep_sleep_pads.c).

