config TLSR_BLE_STACK_SIZE
	int "BLE thread stack size"
	default 1152 if TC32_P256_PKE
	default 1792
	help
	  The thread runs the Secure Connections pairing. In the whole-keyboard
	  emulator (CONFIG_INIT_STACKS, the stack read back after a Passkey
	  Entry pairing) it reaches 792 octets with P-256 on the public key
	  engine (TC32_P256_PKE) and about 1,300 with P-256 in software
	  (TC32_P256_SOFT). Each default keeps the peak below three quarters
	  of the stack.

